    "title": "Ally’s Lindsay Sacknoff on Building Trust and Democratizing Rewards",
    "summary": "Competition in digital banking is at an all-time high, which means banks need new ways to differentiate themselves beyond rates, products, and convenience. While consumers need a bank that can help them manage money, they also need a bank that can help them achieve financial goals, enable life experiences, and feel confident in their financial Read more...\nThe post Ally’s Lindsay Sacknoff on Building Trust and Democratizing Rewards appeared first on Finovate.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://finovate.com/allys-lindsay-sacknoff-on-building-trust-and-democratizing-rewards/",
